# shutdown while a character is being created. Halfway, a new name, has chosen a password and stopped at the race
# prompt; Smokegod (60) types shutdown. It saved every connection with a character, so Halfway's player file was
# written at level 0, taking the name (#40). Now only players in the game are saved: there's no file.
@connect new
Halfway
y
secret12
secret12
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
shutdown
@file ../player/Halfway
@file ../player/Smokegod
